vkminer
=======

Maintainer

  tpfue <https://github.com/tpfuemp>


Inherited code
--------------

vkminer's Stratum client, JSON-RPC layer, option and configuration parsing,
share accounting and logging come from cpuminer-opt, and through it from
pooler's cpuminer and Jeff Garzik's original cpuminer. The GPU backend, the
compute shaders and every hash implementation in this tree are new work.

The authors of that inherited code, as credited by cpuminer-opt:

  Jeff Garzik <jgarzik@pobox.com>
